{"kind": "mod", "id": 2663, "name": "Sniper Bros", "slug": "sniper-bros", "teaser": "Sniper Scavs are bros to all bots.", "owner_name": "Shibdib", "downloads": 3223, "favourites": 12, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.shibdib.sniperbros", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:32:25.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-04-13T00:43:19.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-04-13T00:40:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>This mod is simple. It makes Marksman/Sniper scavs non-hostile to other AI bots. Why? Because the AI bots would annoyingly get stuck staring at ceilings trying to find them before.</p>\n<p>Why not just not spawn in marksman you ask? Because how would you do those annoying tasks that require kills for them.</p>\n<p>Install:</p>\n<p>Extract the mod into the main folder of your game install.</p>\n<p>FIKA/Headless:</p>\n<p>This mod only needs to be on the host. So if you use a headless it only needs to be there.</p>\n<p>Compatibility:</p>\n<p>Should work with everything.</p>\n<p>How’s it work?</p>\n<p>On bot spawn in it’ll add bots to the allies list of marksman and vice versa.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 3504, "downloads": 79, "published_at": "2026-04-13T00:45:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2663/sniper-bros/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 3504, "downloads": 69, "published_at": "2026-04-13T01:07:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2663/sni